"4395","Bacon Horseradish Dip","Yum","4.62","2.0","5","14","1 cup    mayonnaise (Best Foods preferred) | 1⁄4 cup    bacon bits | 1 cup    sour cream | 1⁄4 cup    prepared horseradish","Stir all ingredients until well mixed. | Cover; chill. | Makes 2 cups.","","Pork"
