"4400","Shrimp and Cream Cheese Appetizer","yum","4.0","8.0","5","2","1 (8   ounce) package   cream cheese | 1⁄2 cup    seafood cocktail sauce (Nalley's brand preferred) | 1 (4   ounce) package   cooked shrimp (the tiny salad size)","Place cream cheese on serving dish. | Cover with cocktail sauce. | Top with shrimp. | Serve with your favorite crackers or chips.","","Cheese"
