"17115","Gini's Pumpkin Bread","Fragrant and tasty pumpkin bread recipe I received from my dear friend Gini about 30 years ago. A great gift bread.","4.0","1.0","100","2","1 2⁄3 cups    flour | 1 1⁄2 cups    sugar | 1⁄4 teaspoon    baking powder | 1 teaspoon    baking soda | 1⁄2 teaspoon    clove | 1⁄2 teaspoon    cinnamon | 1⁄2 teaspoon    nutmeg | 1⁄2 cup    oil | 1⁄2 cup    water | 1 cup    pumpkin puree (canned is ok) | 2 eggs | 1 cup   chopped dates | 1 cup   chopped nuts","Grease and flour a loaf pan. | Preheat oven to 325°. | Sift dry ingredients together. | Mix oil, water, pumpkin, and eggs together. | Blend in dry ingredients. | Fold in dates and nuts. | Bake at 325° for 1 1/2 hours.","","Breads"
