"45302","Broccoli With Garlic And Parmesan Cheese","The parmesan cheese and garlic really dress up plain old Broccoli with very little effort or time!","4.57","4.0","20","7","2 tablespoons    olive oil | 2 tablespoons   chopped garlic | 2 teaspoons   grated lemons, rind of | 2 lbs    broccoli, stalks discarded,crowns cut into florets | 1⁄2 cup    water | 1⁄2 cup   grated parmesan cheese","Heat oil in large skillet over high heat. | Add garlic and lemon peel and stir 30 seconds. | Add broccoli and toss to coat. | Add 1/2 cup water. | Cover skillet and cook until broccoli is crisp-tender and water has cooked away, about 5 minutes. | Add cheese and toss to coat. | Season with salt and pepper.","","Cheese"
