"45768","The Best Coleslaw Dressing--No Kidding!","I was so sick of the tasteless bottled coleslaw dressings in the grocery store.  One day I was eating my favorite ""Broccoli Salad"" and thought--this tastes similar to coleslaw and so I tried it and--yep, it was exactly the taste I was looking for.  Yum!","4.67","","1","6","1 cup    mayonnaise | 1⁄2 cup    sugar | 2 tablespoons    vinegar","MIX TOGETHER-- WHEW, THAT WAS HARD!","https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/v1/img/recipes/45/76/8/picxawgdO.jpg","Salad Dressings"
