"45808","Taco Seasoning Blend","I don't make tacos very often but this is good to keep on hand,stored in the freezer.","5.0","","10","2","1⁄4 cup    dried onion flakes | 4 teaspoons    cornstarch | 4 teaspoons    chili powder | 3 teaspoons    ground cumin | 3 teaspoons   dried dried garlic | 2 teaspoons   dried hot pepper flakes | 2 teaspoons    beef bouillon powder | 1 1⁄2 teaspoons    dried oregano","Combine all in a container with tight fitting lid. | For tacos add 3 tbsp. | of mix and 1/4 cup water to browned beef.","https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/v1/img/recipes/45/80/8/pic3SOUxi.jpg","Meat"
