"48884","Easy Sticky Buns","Warm, gooey cinnamon buns made fresh for breakfast. Prepare the night before. Bake in the morning. Super easy!","4.94737","12.0","35","21","12 frozen dinner rolls | 1⁄2 cup   melted margarine | 1 cup    brown sugar | 2 tablespoons    cinnamon | 1 large    vanilla pudding mix (NOT instant)","Grease a 9x13 pan. | Place frozen rolls in pan. | Mix remaining ingredients and pour over frozen rolls. | Place in oven overnight. | In the morning, bake at 350 for 20-25 minutes. | Turn out upside down.","https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/v1/img/recipes/48/88/4/picWDtIkr.jpg","Lunch"
