"48895","Mom's Foamy Sauce for Steamed Pudding","This is what we have at Christmastime with our steamed puddings. :)","5.0","1.0","10","1","3 tablespoons    butter | 2 eggs, separated | 1 cup    powdered sugar | 1⁄2 teaspoon    vanilla | 1⁄2 cup    cream, whipped","Cream the butter and sugar together. | Add the well-beaten egg yolks and beat thoroughly over hot water in a double boiler. | Remove from the heat and fold in the stiffly-beaten egg whites, then the vanilla and the whipped cream. | Pour over your favorite steamed pudding. | This is one of our traditional family favorites!","","Sauces"
