"53392","Mesquite Turkey & Cheddar Spread","You can also make a low-fat version of this that would be excellent! Chilling time is not included in prep. time.","0.0","12.0","20","0","8 ounces   mesquite turkey, cubed | 6 ounces    white cheddar cheese | 3⁄4 cup    pecan halves | 3⁄4 cup    sour cream | 1⁄2 teaspoon    dijon-style mustard | 1⁄4 cup    parsley, finely chopped","Finely chop turkey, cheese and pecans. | Mix in sour cream, mustard and parsley. | Refrigerate 3-4 hours for flavors to blend. | Serve with assorted vegetables and crackers.","","Lunch"
